# Pages & Metadata

## Always
- Keep `page.tsx` as a Server Component and export `metadata` with a unique Persian title ending in `| پلنتی`
- Root layout keeps `lang="fa"` and `dir="rtl"`
- Product pages title from the product name
- Decorative photos use `alt=""`. If an image conveys the product name with no nearby text, use a Persian `alt`

## Semantic HTML
- One `h1` per screen. Do not skip heading levels for styling
- `button` for actions, `Link` for navigation
- Forms use `form`, `label`, and `input`
- Order and address cards can be `article`

## Private flows
- Do not add login, cart, checkout, account, or order pages to a public sitemap
- Do not add `generatePageMetadata`, Open Graph assets, or `robots.ts` unless asked

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div onClick={() => router.push('/cart')}>{name}</div>

// ✅ GOOD
<Link href={`/products/${product.id}`}>{product.name}</Link>
```
